            <description><![CDATA[<ul><li>A designed installer: open the DMG and drag ColorPickr onto Applications, following the arrow.</li><li>Opened ColorPickr from the installer or Downloads? It offers to move itself to Applications, reopens from there and ejects the installer.</li><li>Updates show up in the menu bar: a dot on the eyedropper and an <b>Update</b> button in the panel, with the release notes one click away. No pop-ups while you work.</li><li>Settings › Updates can download updates in the background, ready to install when you quit.</li></ul>]]></description>
